{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52555","headline":"其三 · 陈元光","name":"其三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戍楼西北望皇阍，日暖桃绯京国春。\n公子踏青陪御辇，官民结彩庆姻门。\n上林花木胭脂媚，边境桑蔴戟剑屯。\n乳燕东风相对语，老亲上塚孰温存。\n采茶喜钻新榆火，修[禊]（楔）争驱旧虏氛。\n尽醉韶华三月暮，谁闻更鼓二更巡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}